    <section v-if="page === 'dashboard'" class="page-section"><div class="welcome-row"><div><p class="muted">{{ todayLabel }}</p><h2>Your research, at a glance.</h2></div><button class="primary" @click="go('/search/new')"><Plus :size="18" /> New search</button></div><div class="stat-grid"><div class="stat-card"><div class="stat-label">SEARCHES THIS MONTH <Activity :size="17" /></div><strong>24</strong><span class="up">↑ 18.4% <small>vs last month</small></span></div><div class="stat-card"><div class="stat-label">PATENTS SCREENED <FileText :size="17" /></div><strong>1,284</strong><span class="up">↑ 32.1% <small>vs last month</small></span></div><div class="stat-card"><div class="stat-label">CORE PATENTS FOUND <ShieldCheck :size="17" /></div><strong>47</strong><span class="neutral">Across 12 searches</span></div><div class="stat-card dark-stat"><div class="stat-label">ACTIVE SIGNAL <Sparkles :size="17" /></div><strong>82.6</strong><span>Average relevance score</span></div></div><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">RECENT ACTIVITY</p><h3>Search history</h3></div><button class="text-button" @click="go('/my')">View all <ArrowRight :size="15" /></button></div><div class="table-card"><div class="table-row table-head"><span>SEARCH QUERY</span><span>STATUS</span><span>RESULTS</span><span>CREATED</span><span></span></div><div v-for="item in searches" :key="item.id" class="table-row"><div class="query-cell"><div class="query-icon"><Search :size="15" /></div><div><strong>{{ item.query }}</strong><small>{{ item.id }}</small></div></div><span class="status done"><Check :size="13" /> {{ item.status }}</span><span><strong>{{ item.count }}</strong> <small>patents</small></span><span class="muted">{{ item.createdAt }}</span><button class="row-action" @click="go(`/search/${item.id}/results`)"><ChevronRight :size="17" /></button></div></div><div class="trend-callout"><div class="callout-icon"><BarChart3 :size="22" /></div><div><p class="eyebrow">MACRO VIEW</p><h3>Where is the industry moving?</h3><p class="muted">Spot emerging whitespace and track applicant momentum.</p></div><button class="secondary" @click="go('/trends')">Explore trends <ArrowRight :size="16" /></button></div></section>
    <section v-else-if="page === 'new-search'" class="page-section narrow-page"><div class="back-link" @click="go('/dashboard')"><ArrowLeft :size="15" /> Back to overview</div><div class="search-intro"><span class="number-badge">01</span><p class="eyebrow">DEFINE YOUR SIGNAL</p><h2>What are you building?</h2><p class="muted">Describe the technology in your own words. PatentMind will translate it into a precise search.</p></div><div class="form-card search-form"><label class="large-label">Technology specification<textarea v-model="newSearch.query" rows="5" placeholder="e.g. Solid-state battery with sulfide electrolyte and flexible interfacial layer that reduces degradation..."></textarea></label><div class="expand-row"><button type="button" class="secondary" @click="expandQuery"><Sparkles :size="15" /> AI 키워드 확장</button><span class="muted" style="font-size:11px">동의어·영문 변형어·IPC/CPC 코드를 추천합니다</span></div><div v-if="expansion" class="expand-panel"><div class="expand-group"><small>추천 동의어·변형어</small><div class="chip-row"><button type="button" v-for="term in expansion.synonyms" :key="term" class="chip" @click="addTerm(term)">{{ term }} <Plus :size="11" /></button></div></div><div class="expand-group"><small>추천 IPC/CPC 코드</small><div class="chip-row"><button type="button" v-for="code in expansion.ipcCodes" :key="code" class="chip" @click="addTerm(code)">{{ code }} <Plus :size="11" /></button></div></div></div><div class="form-grid"><label>출원 기간<select v-model="newSearch.period"><option>최근 3년</option><option>최근 5년</option><option>최근 10년</option><option>직접 설정</option></select></label><label>대상 출원인<select v-model="newSearch.company"><option>전체 기업</option><option>삼성SDI</option><option>QuantumCell Technologies</option><option>SK On</option></select></label><label class="check" style="margin-top:23px"><input type="checkbox" v-model="newSearch.excludeExpired" /> 소멸·포기 특허 제외</label></div><div v-if="newSearch.period === '직접 설정'" class="form-grid" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr"><label>시작일<input type="date" v-model="newSearch.periodFrom" /></label><label>종료일<input type="date" v-model="newSearch.periodTo" /></label></div><label class="large-label" style="margin-top:21px">검색 대상 국가 (IP5 프리셋)<div class="country-picker"><button type="button" v-for="c in ipCountries" :key="c.code" :class="{selected: newSearch.countries.includes(c.code)}" @click="toggleCountry(c.code)">{{ c.label }}</button></div></label><div class="form-footer"><span class="muted"><ShieldCheck :size="15" /> Your query is private and encrypted</span><button class="primary" @click="createSearch">Run patent search <ArrowRight :size="17" /></button></div></div></section>
    <section v-else-if="page === 'processing'" class="processing-page"><div class="processing-orb"><span><Sparkles :size="28" /></span></div><p class="eyebrow">SEARCH {{ route.params.id }}</p><h2>Reading between the lines.</h2><p class="muted">Our AI is comparing your technology against millions of patent claims.</p><div class="stepper"><div v-for="(step, index) in ['Understanding your technology','Finding relevant patent families','Scoring claim overlap','Checking legal status','Preparing your signal']" :key="step" class="step" :class="{ active: progress >= index * 20, current: progress >= index * 20 && progress < (index + 1) * 20 }"><span class="step-dot"><Check v-if="progress > (index + 1) * 20" :size="14" /><span v-else>{{ index }}</span></span><span>{{ step }}</span><small v-if="progress >= index * 20 && progress < (index + 1) * 20">IN PROGRESS</small></div></div><div class="processing-footer"><span>Typically takes 30–60 seconds</span><strong>{{ progress }}%</strong></div></section>
    <section v-else-if="page === 'results'" class="page-section"><div class="results-toolbar"><div><p class="muted">Search {{ route.params.id }} · 48 patents analyzed</p><h2>Patent signal map</h2></div><button class="secondary"><Filter :size="16" /> More filters</button></div><div class="tier-tabs"><button v-for="tier in tiers" :key="tier.label" :class="{selected: activeTier === tier.label}" @click="activeTier = tier.label"><i :style="{background: tier.color}"></i>{{ tier.text }} <b>{{ tier.label === 'All' ? results.length : tierCount(tier.label) }}</b></button></div><div class="results-list"><article v-for="item in visibleResults" :key="item.id" class="result-card" @click="go(`/search-result/${item.id}`)"><div class="tier-line" :style="{background: tiers.find(t => t.label === item.tier)?.color}"></div><div class="result-main"><div class="result-top"><span class="tier-badge" :class="item.tier.toLowerCase()"><i></i>{{ item.tier }}</span><span class="score">RELEVANCE <strong>{{ item.score }}</strong></span></div><h3>{{ item.title }}</h3><p class="muted">{{ item.abstract }}</p><div class="result-meta"><span><Building2 :size="14" /> {{ item.assignee }}</span><span><FileText :size="14" /> {{ item.year }} · Patent family</span><span><Flag :size="14" /> Confidence {{ item.confidence }}</span></div></div><div class="result-arrow"><ArrowRight :size="18" /></div></article></div></section>
    <section v-else-if="page === 'detail' && detail" class="page-section"><div class="back-link" @click="go('/search/PM-2408/results')"><ArrowLeft :size="15" /> Back to results</div><div class="detail-heading"><div><span class="tier-badge" :class="detail.tier.toLowerCase()"><i></i>{{ detail.tier }} signal</span><h2>{{ detail.title }}</h2><p class="muted">{{ detail.assignee }} · Filed {{ detail.year }} · {{ detail.id }}</p></div></div><div class="detail-grid"><div><div class="detail-card"><div class="card-title"><div><p class="eyebrow">QUANTITATIVE BREAKDOWN</p><h3>Why this signal matters</h3></div><span class="big-score">{{ detail.score }}<small>/100</small></span></div><div class="metric" v-for="metric in detail.metrics" :key="metric.label"><div><span>{{ metric.label }}</span><strong>{{ metric.score }}<small>/{{ metric.max }}</small></strong></div><div class="metric-bar"><span :style="{width: `${(metric.score / metric.max) * 100}%`, background: metric.score / metric.max > 0.8 ? '#ef4444' : metric.score / metric.max > 0.5 ? '#f59e0b' : '#22c55e'}"></span></div></div></div><div class="detail-card"><p class="eyebrow">CLAIM SUMMARY</p><h3>Independent claim, simplified</h3><p class="claim-text">{{ detail.claim }}</p></div></div><aside><div class="detail-card side-card"><div class="side-title"><h3>Review status</h3><span class="status-dot"></span></div><label class="switch-row"><span><strong>Needs attention</strong><small>Pin this patent to your workspace</small></span><input v-model="confirmNeeded" type="checkbox" @change="toggleConfirm" /><i></i></label><textarea v-model="note" rows="4" placeholder="Add a note for your team..."></textarea><button class="secondary wide" @click="toggleConfirm"><Check :size="15" /> Save note</button></div><div class="detail-card"><p class="eyebrow">QUALITATIVE ASSESSMENT</p><div class="assessment"><span>로드맵·스펙 중첩도</span><b :class="levelClass(detail.confidence)">{{ detail.confidence }}</b></div><div class="assessment"><span>회피설계 난이도</span><b :class="levelClass(detail.designDifficulty)">{{ detail.designDifficulty }}</b></div></div></aside></div></section>
    <section v-else-if="page === 'trends'" class="page-section"><div class="section-intro"><div><p class="eyebrow">THE BIGGER PICTURE</p><h2>Macro technology trends</h2><p class="muted">Track where innovation is accelerating around your search.</p></div><select class="period-select"><option>Last 5 years</option><option>Last 10 years</option></select></div><div class="trend-grid"><div class="chart-card wide-chart"><div class="card-title"><div><p class="eyebrow">APPLICATION MOMENTUM</p><h3>Patent applications by year</h3></div><span class="chart-legend"><i></i> All applicants</span></div><div class="line-chart"><div class="chart-y"><span>150</span><span>100</span><span>50</span><span>0</span></div><svg viewBox="0 0 600 210" preserveAspectRatio="none"><path d="M0 182 C75 170, 90 148, 150 155 S235 111, 300 124 S390 83, 450 68 S540 44, 600 18" fill="none" stroke="#ef4444" stroke-width="4"/><path d="M0 182 C75 170, 90 148, 150 155 S235 111, 300 124 S390 83, 450 68 S540 44, 600 18 L600 210 L0 210Z" fill="url(#fill)" opacity=".14"/><defs><linearGradient id="fill" x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="1"><stop stop-color="#ef4444"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#fff"/></linearGradient></defs></svg><div class="chart-x"><span v-for="point in trendData" :key="point.year">{{ point.year }}</span></div></div></div><div class="chart-card"><div class="card-title"><div><p class="eyebrow">TOP APPLICANTS</p><h3>Who is moving first?</h3></div></div><div v-for="(name, i) in ['QuantumCell','NeoVolt Labs','Samsung SDI','Panasonic Energy']" :key="name" class="applicant"><span>0{{ i + 1 }}</span><div><strong>{{ name }}</strong><small>{{ 42 - i * 6 }} applications</small></div><b>+{{ 28 - i * 6 }}%</b></div></div></div><div class="heatmap-card"><div class="card-title"><div><p class="eyebrow">WHITE SPACE MAP</p><h3>Where could you own the next layer?</h3></div><span class="muted">Low saturation <i class="heat-legend"></i> High saturation</span></div><div class="heatmap"><div v-for="(row, r) in [[3,5,2,4],[7,8,6,3],[2,4,9,6],[5,3,7,8]]" :key="r" class="heat-row"><span class="heat-row-label">{{ ['QuantumCell','NeoVolt Labs','Samsung SDI','Panasonic Energy'][r] }}</span><span v-for="(cell, c) in row" :key="c" :class="`heat-${cell}`">{{ cell > 7 ? 'Crowded' : cell > 5 ? 'Ripe' : 'Open' }}</span></div></div><div class="heat-labels"><span></span><span>Materials</span><span>Interface</span><span>Manufacturing</span><span>Thermal</span></div></div></section>
    <section v-else-if="page === 'my'" class="page-section"><div class="section-intro"><div><p class="eyebrow">YOUR RESEARCH</p><h2>My workspace</h2><p class="muted">Everything you have searched, saved, and flagged.</p></div><button class="primary" @click="go('/search/new')"><Plus :size="17" /> New search</button></div><div class="workspace-tabs"><button class="selected">Search history <b>24</b></button><button>Needs attention <b>6</b></button></div><div class="table-card my-table"><div class="table-row table-head"><span>SEARCH QUERY</span><span>DATE</span><span>RESULTS</span><span>CORE SIGNALS</span><span></span></div><div v-for="item in searches" :key="item.id" class="table-row"><div class="query-cell"><div class="query-icon"><Search :size="15" /></div><div><strong>{{ item.query }}</strong><small>{{ item.id }}</small></div></div><span class="muted">{{ item.createdAt }}</span><span>{{ item.count }}</span><span class="core-text">{{ item.core }} Core</span><button class="row-action" @click="go(`/search/${item.id}/results`)"><ChevronRight :size="17" /></button></div></div></section>
    <section v-else-if="page === 'admin'" class="page-section"><div class="section-intro"><div><p class="eyebrow">SYSTEM CONTROL</p><h2>Admin console</h2><p class="muted">Tune scoring logic and monitor data freshness.</p></div><button class="secondary"><RefreshCw :size="16" /> Sync all sources</button></div><div class="admin-single"><div class="form-card"><div class="card-title"><div><p class="eyebrow">DATA PIPELINES</p><h3>External sync logs</h3></div><Activity :size="19" /></div><div v-for="log in logs" :key="log.source" class="log-row"><div class="source-icon"><Database :size="16" /></div><div><strong>{{ log.source }}</strong><small>{{ log.time }} · {{ log.records }} records</small></div><span :class="['status', log.status === '완료' ? 'done' : 'pending']">{{ log.status }}</span></div></div></div></section><section v-else-if="page === 'help'" class="page-section narrow-page"><div class="section-intro"><div><p class="eyebrow">SUPPORT</p><h2>도움말 센터</h2><p class="muted">PatentMind AI의 핵심 기능을 확인하고, 궁금한 점이나 개선 의견을 남겨주세요.</p></div></div><div class="detail-card"><div class="card-title"><div><p class="eyebrow">기능 안내</p><h3>주요 기능 설명</h3></div><FileText :size="19" /></div><div v-for="topic in helpTopics" :key="topic.title" class="log-row" style="align-items:flex-start"><div class="source-icon"><CircleHelp :size="16" /></div><div><strong>{{ topic.title }}</strong><small style="white-space:normal;line-height:1.6">{{ topic.desc }}</small></div></div></div><div class="form-card"><div class="card-title"><div><p class="eyebrow">CONTACT</p><h3>문의 · 건의사항 접수</h3></div><Sparkles :size="19" /></div><div v-if="feedbackSubmitted" class="switch-row" style="border:0"><div><strong>접수가 완료되었습니다</strong><small>접수 번호 {{ feedbackId }} · 검토 후 답변은 별도로 안내드릴 예정입니다.</small></div><button class="secondary" @click="feedbackSubmitted = false">새 문의 작성</button></div><form v-else @submit.prevent="submitFeedback" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px"><label style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#4d5965">제목<input v-model="feedbackForm.subject" type="text" placeholder="문의 제목을 입력해주세요" /></label><label class="large-label" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#4d5965">내용<textarea v-model="feedbackForm.message" rows="5" placeholder="문의하거나 건의하고 싶은 내용을 자세히 적어주세요"></textarea></label><button class="primary wide" type="submit">문의 접수하기 <ArrowRight :size="16" /></button></form></div></section>
  </div></main><div v-if="toast" class="toast"><Check :size="16" /> {{ toast }}</div></div>
</template>
